  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">aims at strengthening  GBV prevention and response through nation-wide media and community mobilization campaigns, with specific objectives as follows; - Raising awareness about the prevalence and impact of violence against women in various communities.- Empowering women and girls with knowledge about their rights and available resources for support. - Mobilizing community action through outreach that encourage dialogue and engagement.- Fostering partnerships among local organizations to enhance support services for survivors of violence</narrative>
